"Lobby List, Text Chat & Quick Match are Live!","posttime":1789325333,"updatetime":1789325400,"body":"[p]A new patch has just been released for the [b]Gun a Rat[\/b] demo![\/p][p]Thanks to your feedback, we've added several major features to make the multiplayer experience much smoother, especially for solo players:[\/p][p][b]Available Right Now:[\/b][\/p][list][*][p][b]Lobby List (Lobby Browser):[\/b] Browse the full list of open public games and pick whichever session you want to join.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Lobby Text Chat:[\/b] Type and chat with your teammates right inside the lobby menu to plan your strategy before starting the match.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Quick Matchmaking:[\/b] Automatically find and jump into an open public game in seconds.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]Thank you all for playing and sharing your feedback! Try out the new features, let us know what you think in the Community Hub, and don't forget to [b]add Gun a Rat to your Wishlist[\/b]![\/p]","commentcount":0,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1888979151_1789326370_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"562541966849619701","event_gid":"672879825739842370","voteupcount":1,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":1789325280,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"562541966849619701","rtime32_last_modified":1789655203,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1789326370,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1789325321,"votes_up":1,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"571543760192907584","gidfeature2":"562541966849619701"},{"gid":"672879825739842181","clan_steamid":"103582791475377682","event_name":"Hotfix: Giant Items Bug Fixed!","event_type":28,"appid":4163660,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1789152960,"rtime32_end_time":1789156560,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"A funny but annoying visual bug with items picked up by rats has been patched.\",null,\"Un bug visuel amusant mais g\u00eanant li\u00e9 aux objets ramass\u00e9s par le rat vient d'\u00eatre corrig\u00e9.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"Quick update: Fixed a bug where items would turn oversized when picked up by a rat.\",null,\"Mise \u00e0 jour rapide : correction du bug qui affichait certains objets en taille g\u00e9ante lorsqu'ils \u00e9taient ramass\u00e9s.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"ddca114aacc870c6372656334f63d9bd22ba365f.png\",null,\"ddca114aacc870c6372656334f63d9bd22ba365f.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"64e920e17d5ec5de3367900d2d568f293fd4ff10.png\",null,\"64e920e17d5ec5de3367900d2d568f293fd4ff10.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"672879825739842182","clanid":"45856274","posterid":"0","headline":"Hotfix: Giant Items Bug Fixed!","posttime":1789152992,"updatetime":1789152992,"body":"[quote][p]A quick patch has just been released for the [b]Gun a Rat[\/b] demo![\/p][p][b]What was fixed:[\/b][\/p][list][*][p][b]Giant Items Bug:[\/b] Some players reported that items would occasionally become insanely huge when picked up by a rat. This visual issue is now completely [b]fixed[\/b]! Items will now stay at their intended size.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]Thank you all for reporting bugs and sharing feedback. Keep sending your reports in the Community Hub, and don't forget to [b]add Gun a Rat to your Wishlist[\/b]![\/p][\/quote]","commentcount":0,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1878895840_1789154467_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"562541634873754873","event_gid":"672879825739842181","voteupcount":1,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"562541634873754873","rtime32_last_modified":1789655207,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1789154467,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1789152952,"votes_up":1,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"571543760192907584","gidfeature2":"562541634873754873"},{"gid":"668376859863416980","clan_steamid":"103582791475377682","event_name":"Major Update: Balancing, Crosshair Customization & Match Settings!","event_type":12,"appid":4163660,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1789606800,"rtime32_end_time":1789612201,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Gameplay adjustments, crosshair settings, new match configuration options, and bug fixes.\",null,\"Ajustements de gameplay, personnalisation du crosshair, nouveaux param\u00e8tres de partie et correctifs divers.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"Major update: new match settings, crosshair customization, rat and exterminator balancing, and bug fixes.\",null,\"Grosse mise \u00e0 jour : nouveaux param\u00e8tres de partie, personnalisation du viseur, ajustements du rat et de l'exterminateur, et correctifs.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"668376859863416981","clanid":"45856274","posterid":"0","headline":"Major Update: Balancing, Crosshair Customization & Match Settings!","posttime":1789606833,"updatetime":1789606833,"body":"[p]A major patch has just been released for the Gun a Rat demo![\/p][p][b]New Features & Customization:[\/b][\/p][list][*][p][b]Crosshair Customization:[\/b] You can now select your crosshair style (dot, open circle, cross, or none) and customize its color directly from the pause menu.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Points per Rat Selector:[\/b] In the Start and Replay menus, you can now adjust the points awarded per rat (from 1 to 30). The maximum target score is automatically capped by the total points available on the map.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]Gameplay Balancing:[\/b][\/p][list][*][p][b]Rat Buffs:[\/b] Increased rat stamina (+5%) and stamina regeneration speed (+5%).[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Rat Hitbox:[\/b] Slightly enlarged the rat's side hitbox to make shooting more consistent for the exterminator.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Poison Effect:[\/b] Increased the delay between shots when suffering from poison.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]General Rebalancing:[\/b] Minor global tweaks to improve overall game flow.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]Bug Fixes & Fixes:[\/b][\/p][list][*][p][b]Pistol Bug:[\/b] Fixed an issue where players could shoot faster than the intended fire rate.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Exterminator Selector:[\/b] Fixed a bug related to the exterminator selection tool.[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Lobby Player List:[\/b] Resolved an issue where player profile pictures appeared fully white initially in the lobby player list.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]Thank you for all your feedback! Enjoy the update and don't forget to add Gun a Rat to your Wishlist![\/p]","commentcount":0,"tags":["patchnotes","mod_reviewed","ModAct_1751692459_1789607656_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"571549538645482707","event_gid":"668376859863416980","voteupcount":3,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"571549538645482707","rtime32_last_modified":1790462258,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1789607656,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1789606768,"votes_up":3,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"571543760192907584","gidfeature2":"571549538645482707"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["672879825739842371","672879825739842182"],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1789606800,"event_gid":"668376859863416980","announcement_gid":"668376859863416981","clan_account_id":45856274}}};
						</script>
					

					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				


								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Gun a Rat</strong> is a fast-paced asymmetrical multiplayer game to play with your friends.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Play as the <strong>Rats</strong> and wreck the house... or as the <strong>Exterminator</strong>, and wipe them out down to the last one.<br>Start matches from 2 to 20 players on a variety of maps, each with its own share of surprises, with <strong>3 game modes</strong> to choose from…</p><br><br><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>A very special voice chat...</strong></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Rats</strong> can talk to each other through voice chat without fear of being understood.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >The <strong>Exterminator</strong> only hears squeaks instead of their words!</p></li></ul><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.poster.avif?t=1792792863" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.webm?t=1792792863" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.mp4?t=1792792863" type="video/mp4"></video></span><br><br><br><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Your goal as a Rat:</strong></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Reach the target score by destroying and stealing objects before time runs out, without getting killed!</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" >But be careful... every destruction makes a noise that will give you away!</p><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.poster.avif?t=1792792863" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.webm?t=1792792863" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.mp4?t=1792792863" type="video/mp4"></video></span><br><br><br><p class="bb_paragraph" >If the <strong>Exterminator</strong> is hunting you down,<br>quickly hide in the furniture to escape their gaze.</p><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.poster.avif?t=1792792863" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.webm?t=1792792863" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.mp4?t=1792792863" type="video/mp4"></video></span><br><br><br><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>As the Exterminator:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Use your <strong>camera</strong> to track the rats' movements and find out where they're hiding...</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Place your <strong>traps</strong> carefully to slow them down as much as possible</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Kill</strong> them all!</p></li></ul><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.poster.avif?t=1792792863" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.webm?t=1792792863" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.mp4?t=1792792863" type="video/mp4"></video></span><br><br><br><p class="bb_paragraph" >A wide range of traps is at your disposal,<br>each one holding its own nasty surprises for the <strong>Rats</strong>...</p><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.poster.avif?t=1792792863" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.webm?t=1792792863" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.mp4?t=1792792863" type="video/mp4"></video></span><br><br><br><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>3 game modes to keep things fresh:</strong></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Classic</strong>: smash and steal as many objects as you can to reach the target score before time runs out!</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Hide and Seek</strong>: earn points by looking at the <strong>Exterminator</strong>... but stay well hidden so you don't get spotted!</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Bomb Tag</strong>: an explosive game of tag! Pass the bomb to another player before it blows up in your snout!</p></li></ul><br><br><p class="bb_paragraph" >Play match after match to earn <strong>Cheese Coins</strong>,<br>and spend them on skins to customize your rat!</p><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.poster.avif?t=1792792863" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.webm?t=1792792863" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.mp4?t=1792792863" type="video/mp4"></video></span><br><br><br><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>So, which side will you be on?</strong></p></p>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
